<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_bf35aa43-90f6-4af8-9e40-208ab90e977b"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f7027cc8-f9db-4144-b02d-f44869c1e952"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act:</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_c68e1b9b-cb39-48fc-aa50-c36cb5de77f0"
id="sec.3-def.appropriatelifejacket"><b><i>appropriate
lifejacket</i></b></defterm> means a lifejacket of a kind prescribed by the
regulations.</txt>
<note type="legtext" guid="_8c532dac-cfb8-42a4-b978-c5b42eb49545"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-note"><heading guid="_e0577c11-9a04-4aa3-8c27-b98c6735b317"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">Clause 3 of Schedule 1 prescribes certain
lifejackets as appropriate lifejackets until the regulations make other
provision.</txt></block></note>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_29c65537-24d5-4072-bd93-a0becd456f7c"
id="sec.3-def.authorisedofficer"><b><i>authorised officer</i></b></defterm>
means the following:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_411464d7-d0d4-4490-ad14-d6a6ee8e24e0" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a fisheries officer within the meaning of the
<legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="act-1994-038"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Fisheries Management Act
1994</i></name></legref>,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_d9c03af2-cf98-4509-a7e6-622eb1dd0128" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a person employed by a local council, or subject
to its control or direction, who is an authorised person (within the meaning
of the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown"
refid="act-1993-030"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Local Government Act
1993</i></name></legref>) for the purposes of section 679 (Penalty notices for
certain offences) of that Act, but only within the local government area of
the local council concerned,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6a646dcf-af9b-40f3-a506-c4656c6bf167" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">an officer of the Service within the meaning of
the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="act-1974-080"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>National Parks and Wildlife Act
1974</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_1d28289e-14c9-4ef5-ad06-1d929495c959" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a police officer.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_c19b319b-2538-4341-a309-1b4c7155cfbf"
id="sec.3-def.child"><b><i>child</i></b></defterm> means a person who is under
the age of 12 years.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_3cd8cdb9-808f-4a82-8e69-dad3a588cf76"
id="sec.3-def.fish"><b><i>fish</i></b></defterm> has the same meaning as in
the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="act-1994-038"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Fisheries Management Act
1994</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_176da989-3e08-4e90-badf-441f164b69df"
id="sec.3-def.highriskrockfishinglocation"><b><i>high risk rock fishing
location</i></b></defterm>&#8212;see section 4.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_df65ddbd-d78c-4e1d-8aaf-d1d05b1e4f6c"
id="sec.3-def.RecreationalFishingSaltwaterTrustFund"><b><i>Recreational
Fishing (Saltwater) Trust Fund</i></b></defterm> means the Recreational
Fishing (Saltwater) Trust Fund established under Division 3 of Part 8 of the
<legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="act-1994-038"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Fisheries Management Act
1994</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_a288f815-8716-4cde-acf0-3148ef5fb125"
id="sec.3-def.take"><b><i>take</i></b></defterm> fish has the same meaning as
in the <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown"
refid="act-1994-038"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Fisheries Management Act
1994</i></name></legref>.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_5bb3fb4f-72b2-4047-b11b-36a370f1a04b"
id="sec.3-def.wear"><b><i>wear</i></b></defterm>, in relation to a lifejacket,
means wear with all closing or fastening devices such as zippers, buckles and
tapes correctly secured as specified by the
manufacturer.</txt></block></deflist>
</block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_028b2f19-bbf6-4bfa-a5f1-06677cc9990a"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-note-oc.2"><heading
guid="_1170718b-76a5-4fd9-9f71-0d9f7851e500"
id="sec.3-ssec.1-note-oc.2-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW"
check="unknown" refid="act-1987-015"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Interpretation
Act 1987</i></name></legref> contains definitions and other provisions that
affect the interpretation and application of this Act.</txt></block></note>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fb05a140-811c-4bbc-8dc1-0f7f22f4d0d6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Notes included in this Act do not form part of
this Act.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_43b87f62-57d8-4f48-89ef-78cbf5934efd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_b46cbd53-4335-477e-b220-f55f88402d20"
id="sec.4-he"><b>High risk rock fishing locations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1336de09-93e8-4ea3-ad14-8b89c83d5715"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Minister may, by order published in the
Gazette, declare an area to be an area where high risk rock fishing takes
place (a <defterm type="definition"
guid="_7ce72d1b-084b-41ab-8666-a54edb0537b7"
id="sec.4-def.declaredarea"><b><i>declared
area</i></b></defterm>).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_c6331082-b45a-40d4-9223-ccbc1037ec78"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act, a <defterm type="definition"
guid="_6fcfb49a-b9b2-4923-9352-9192ab28a54e"
id="sec.4-def.highriskrockfishinglocation"><b><i>high risk rock fishing
location</i></b></defterm> is a naturally occurring rock platform or other
rock formation exposed to ocean swell within a declared
area.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4da685ed-de1c-4d7f-adf2-6a26c1c7303b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Secretary of the Department of Planning,
Industry and Environment is to cause the following to be published on a
publicly accessible website maintained by the Department:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_014df5d2-280c-4bca-b1b2-f4fb99380f0e" id="sec.4-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">each declared area, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_17506b01-7be7-4059-9064-bf2ec716a893" id="sec.4-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a description and map that identify the high risk
rock fishing locations within the declared area.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 4:</b> Am 2019 No 1,
Sch 2.26 [1] [2].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a46446e1-1819-4d58-8776-0ea62c4c3fb2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_e04b1fbb-f6a3-4400-b44f-a99a80bde4bd"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Rock fishing without lifejacket at high risk
locations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_90d2f634-43d6-419b-920d-ad4eb247ff25"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person must not take fish by means of a rod and
line or handline, or assist a person to take fish in that manner (for example,
by using a handheld net to assist the person to land fish), at a high risk
rock fishing location unless the person is wearing an appropriate
lifejacket.</txt></block>

<tier type="penalty" id="sec.5-ssec.1-pen">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="guid" value="_706a5c2e-7d5c-4bdc-8aa0-209e7d50a315"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1-pen"></attrib></parentattributes>

<block><txt break.before="1">Maximum penalty: 50 penalty
units.</txt></block></tier>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_98033aa8-3efa-40d8-b638-2ce67219f0ef"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person must not permit a child in the
person&#8217;s care or supervision at a high risk rock fishing location to
take fish by means of a rod and line or handline, or assist a person to take
fish in that manner, unless the child is wearing an appropriate
lifejacket.</txt></block>

<tier type="penalty" id="sec.5-ssec.2-pen">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ca19f33c-438f-42e9-a5df-c4e1539e64f8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2-pen"></attrib></parentattributes>

<block><txt break.before="1">Maximum penalty: 50 penalty
units.</txt></block></tier>
</tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d068d6a5-2872-41d6-bbe4-ba35943b3250"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_74443a21-b02a-49ab-811b-c881bed90bcc"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Authorised officer may demand name and
address</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_18c7be80-11fd-4d3b-8be5-978dceafeb33"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An authorised officer may require a person whom
the authorised officer suspects on reasonable grounds to have committed, or to
be committing, an offence against this Act or the regulations to state the
person&#8217;s full name and residential address.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ad2effc9-c95c-4f52-9092-7c0c959e4246"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person must not fail to comply with a
requirement made by an authorised officer under subsection (1).</txt></block>

<tier type="penalty" id="sec.6-ssec.2-pen">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e6218cb4-bbe9-4720-8da1-3886f9cdf1a8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.2-pen"></attrib></parentattributes>

<block><txt break.before="1">Maximum penalty: 50 penalty
units.</txt></block></tier>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.6-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fd0d7b8c-85c0-4bf0-9308-d8fbe7b121a7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person is not guilty of an offence under this
section unless it is established that the authorised officer:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_b4c12517-2568-4a7d-9310-875fe91feba7" id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">warned the person that failure to comply with the
requirement is an offence, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_43ef7c20-2e17-41de-994f-41d39f347a1c" id="sec.6-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">identified himself or herself to the person as an
authorised officer.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e183b98a-72b0-422f-b505-72875f8c2bc7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_e077ea15-4069-4e30-b1d6-cd2295bb778e"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Nature of proceedings for offences</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Proceedings for an offence under this Act or the
regulations may be dealt with summarily before the Local
Court.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e841ad62-82ab-4ed9-a8ca-3fc84cfc67b6"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_f3b8bbac-9efb-456d-bab2-d6095cf10408"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Penalty notices</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cb869b1c-4d37-4424-b12c-7d60d792f713"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An authorised officer may issue a penalty notice
to a person if it appears to the officer that the person has committed a
penalty notice offence.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_19925e67-8538-4382-9650-2624400749f1"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A penalty notice offence is an offence against
this Act or the regulations that is prescribed by the regulations as a penalty
notice offence.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_bd03214d-19ba-4562-8b73-7e5597763a52"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW"
check="unknown" refid="act-1996-099"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Fines Act
1996</i></name></legref> applies to a penalty notice issued under this
section.</txt></block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_66ac0b7b-9001-4a9b-8084-6ffe190462fa"
id="sec.8-ssec.3-note"><heading guid="_bd82e208-5f65-4eca-b795-57c1f29c9ff4"
id="sec.8-ssec.3-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">The <legref type="act" jurisd="NSW"
check="unknown" refid="act-1996-099"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Fines Act
1996</i></name></legref> provides that, if a person issued with a penalty
notice does not wish to have the matter determined by a court, the person may
pay the amount specified in the notice and is not liable to any further
proceedings for the alleged offence.</txt></block></note>
</tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_12689760-3572-4bae-91fa-ee788b967cdd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The amount payable under a penalty notice issued
under this section is the amount prescribed for the alleged offence by the
regulations (not exceeding the maximum amount of penalty that could be imposed
for the offence by a court).</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.8-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_1cf214e4-e15c-4f52-a689-6899c64ce145"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This section does not limit the operation of any
other provision of, or made under, this or any other Act relating to
proceedings that may be taken in respect of offences.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b6dd156d-b022-4c74-8695-de2b9d93e385"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_b61fb31f-c0d8-4ecc-a55e-425d9108c926"
id="sec.9-he"><b>Fines to be paid into Recreational Fishing (Saltwater) Trust
Fund</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The following amounts are to be paid into the
Recreational Fishing (Saltwater) Trust Fund:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_29c8b82f-43ae-4569-938a-1992eff8ba5d" id="sec.9-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all amounts of penalties recovered with respect
to offences under this Act, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_bbdbe804-c669-49da-b430-a0cd3f6e1c41" id="sec.9-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">all amounts recovered by means of penalty notices
for any such offences issued under this Act.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.10">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a278157b-dc5a-4c34-884c-d9a1b89d7ca7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>10</no><heading guid="_3bdf1ccd-1799-4262-8b1a-509f1cf187d3"
id="sec.10-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3bef97ff-5ba1-4596-ba2c-6958a1940e9b"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The Governor may make regulations, not
inconsistent with this Act, for or with respect to any matter that by this Act
is required or permitted to be prescribed or that is necessary or convenient
to be prescribed for carrying out or giving effect to this
Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.10-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_86c70fa9-1eaa-4c5c-bd15-e75354cdeb30"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.10-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The regulations may create an offence punishable
by a penalty not exceeding 10 penalty units.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</content>


<content type="schedules">

<level type="schedule" id="sch.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="type" value="schedule"></attrib>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
