<attrib name="id" value="sch.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Schedule 1</b></no><heading
guid="_1d6a9065-5059-4d83-bc0e-443ea7de3ffa" id="sch.1-he"><b>Savings,
transitional and other provisions</b></heading></head>

<level type="part" id="sch.1-pt.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e77cae50-c49f-41b3-8439-bf4a929c72a8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-pt.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 1</b></no><heading guid="_84395df7-d615-41c8-ad2f-78fe8400a8b6"
id="sch.1-pt.1-he"><b>Preliminary</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_6b86b5d2-3fff-42ff-bb54-7325b1565a69"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_c3a5cb81-cda1-407d-bee3-ec4fc7a74cd3"
id="sch.1-sec.1-he"><b>Regulations</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a7994a18-eb5f-4656-afb5-6f73d1d4606c"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The regulations may contain provisions of a
savings or transitional nature consequent on the enactment of this Act or any
Act that amends this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_a5073877-2c5d-4e47-ada7-baf013a3a396"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any such provision may, if the regulations so
provide, take effect from the date of assent to the Act concerned or a later
date.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_fa4ddcf7-55bf-4e01-9923-2e97b94fde4d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">To the extent to which any such provision takes
effect from a date that is earlier than the date of its publication on the NSW
legislation website, the provision does not operate so as:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_2286a768-c70d-459e-a8f6-1df7381bb8d6" id="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to affect, in a manner prejudicial to any person
(other than the State or an authority of the State), the rights of that person
existing before the date of its publication, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_6217865c-d440-42c6-905a-f6fa7df79b45" id="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">to impose liabilities on any person (other than
the State or an authority of the State) in respect of anything done or omitted
to be done before the date of its publication.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3d959201-874e-4b30-b999-846b2b639a4e"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Any such provision has effect despite anything to
the contrary in this Schedule.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_e61ac4fc-ab87-42f5-95c6-229dc0add787"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.1-ssec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(5)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The regulations may make separate savings and
transitional provisions or amend this Schedule to consolidate the savings and
transitional provisions.</txt></block></tier>
</level>
</level>


<level type="part" id="sch.1-pt.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2e84d1fc-086e-46de-b467-6e887ecd0082"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-pt.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no><b>Part 2</b></no><heading guid="_2a0f64de-d68c-45ad-a5d1-5c20b0fa87f4"
id="sch.1-pt.2-he"><b>Provisions consequent on enactment of this
Act</b></heading></head>

<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_aa4f6899-c32f-48b3-9edc-b2c3075697d0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_fdeec14a-1a66-4924-b0a9-f81da8839a37"
id="sch.1-sec.2-he"><b>Moratorium on prosecution for offence of rock fishing
without lifejacket</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0ae60464-7a4b-4a4b-aa78-755d2a4050a3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no><heading guid="_536ee440-3989-4aa1-b84c-52e587c8858c"
id="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.1-he"><b>Initial moratorium for 12
months</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A person may not be convicted of an offence
against section 5 (or issued with a penalty notice for that offence) in
relation to an activity that occurs within 12 months after the commencement of
that section.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3a0cde3c-280f-4572-b6b8-3baf2b45bbc8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no><heading guid="_ef9a41f1-10cb-4fe7-8d0d-b5efdd2dbffe"
id="sch.1-sec.2-ssec.2-he"><b>Moratorium by regulation for newly declared high
risk rock fishing locations</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">The regulations may provide that a person may not
be convicted of an offence against section 5 (or issued with a penalty notice
for that offence) in relation to an activity at a place that occurs within 12
months after the declaration of the place as a high risk rock fishing
location.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4044e5d8-f27b-44aa-adea-bb899f881f51"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_3559db60-3c9b-40f5-a9b1-d75cc84357d1"
id="sch.1-sec.3-he"><b>Transitional provision&#8212;appropriate
lifejackets</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ee14983a-3ce8-49f7-8f31-12744a25fd52"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Until the regulations otherwise provide, an
<defterm type="definition" guid="_63bf1bcb-1af0-4a40-aa16-336bb0c48dbe"
id="sch.1-sec.3-def.appropriatelifejacket"><b><i>appropriate
lifejacket</i></b></defterm> for the purposes of this Act is a lifejacket
that:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_eff2f4a9-521f-4aaf-b880-2a3a472ad414" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in relation to a child&#8212;meets performance
level 100 or greater of Australian Standard <extref
type="standard"><citation>AS 4758</citation>, <name
emphasis="yes"><i>Lifejackets</i></name></extref> (as in force from time to
time) that complies with the requirements set out in Schedule 7 to the <legref
type="subordleg" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown" refid="sl-2016-0308"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Marine Safety Regulation 2016</i></name></legref> for that
lifejacket, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_fff7b82c-a141-4ede-bb97-bc8876785d89" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">in any other case&#8212;meets performance level
50S or greater of Australian Standard <extref type="standard"><citation>AS
4758</citation>, <name emphasis="yes"><i>Lifejackets</i></name></extref> (as
in force from time to time) that complies with the requirements set out in
Schedule 7 to the <legref type="subordleg" jurisd="NSW" check="unknown"
refid="sl-2016-0308"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Marine Safety Regulation
2016</i></name></legref> for that lifejacket.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d5ba3175-b445-4f84-b844-85853f6925b2"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Despite subclause (1), a lifejacket is not an
<defterm type="definition" guid="_3d6685e5-c05a-4bfb-9d9a-3f83329bbd27"
id="sch.1-sec.3-def.appropriatelifejacket-oc.2"><b><i>appropriate
lifejacket</i></b></defterm> for the purposes of this clause if:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_32df56aa-cc0b-4f4b-891a-0f32dc337af2" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.2-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the lifejacket relies solely on oral inflation
for buoyancy, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_5d8b5808-e317-4802-ab02-9154867852a6" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.2-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the lifejacket is not the correct size for the
wearer, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_05900aec-de95-4b96-90ae-4e0c9ced898b" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.2-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the lifejacket is not in good
condition.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_30e5e5b1-3382-4186-b4d8-6a0233c84bdd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Despite subclause (1), an inflatable lifejacket
is not an <defterm type="definition"
guid="_2e073d8c-d7c3-4ab4-9016-23d11b24e087"
id="sch.1-sec.3-def.appropriatelifejacket-oc.3"><b><i>appropriate
lifejacket</i></b></defterm> for the purposes of this clause unless:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_68e857a8-3f19-4886-9673-192a581a915c" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the lifejacket was purchased or otherwise
acquired new by the current owner no more than 12 months ago,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_a7986b18-747c-4d05-b24d-686491a7a638" id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the lifejacket has been serviced:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_3e316dcc-2553-4ce7-baf4-ab1c9f8fd821"
id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.3-para1.b-para2.i">
<no>(i)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">at intervals of 12 months or less,
or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_9913ebb7-bf4a-4efd-81c6-9df2940d4c82"
id="sch.1-sec.3-ssec.3-para1.b-para2.ii">
<no>(ii)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">at least at such longer intervals as are
indicated by the manufacturer&#8217;s instructions (if any) provided for the
lifejacket.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></li></list>
</block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sch.1-sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ffa6ec23-a988-4661-98ef-5f6c13647ecd"></attrib>
