<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_d746ff75-b629-4f43-bac8-711449475fc7"
id="sch.1-sec.4-he"><b>Transitional provision&#8212;penalty notices: section
8</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Until the regulations otherwise provide:</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_856dc075-008d-4fbb-ab30-6c9f254ad5da" id="sch.1-sec.4-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">an offence under section 5 is taken to be an
offence for which a penalty notice may be issued, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7e34b891-b145-4ce5-a0b2-e84de720f3fe" id="sch.1-sec.4-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the amount payable under any such penalty notice
is $100.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></level>
</level>
</level>
</content>


